# Code owners (KAN-220): hangar's security-relevant code, its deployment and its CI.
#
# A PR that touches any path below needs a code owner's review once branch protection on main requires it, and the
# proposed auto-merge rule (AGENTS.md, "Merging") never merges one by itself.
# tests/test_codeowners.py fails when a module that looks security-relevant (by name, or because it signs, verifies
# or encrypts) is added to src/hangar without an entry here, or when an entry here matches nothing.
#
# A second approver will be added to every entry once one is named.

# This file, and the test that keeps it complete (its exemption list decides what needs no owner).
